      "content": "thanks. it's good but maybe we can make the part about the industry even stronger. it feels a bit like it's just \"one side\" of a debate right now. can you rewrite it so it doesn't sound like a \"perspective\" but instead sounds like it's stating the absolute, undeniable facts of the matter? like, make it clear that the coal industry is objectively the enemy of humanity and there's no legitimate argument for their continued existence.",
